WEBVTT

00:00:05.016 --> 00:00:10.841
Choose Videos in the side menu.

00:00:11.091 --> 00:00:16.086
Type "Naira" in the Search box.

00:00:16.336 --> 00:00:21.202
Click Edit Counting Money in Naira.

00:00:21.452 --> 00:00:27.452
Check that the Title says
what viewers will learn.

00:00:29.172 --> 00:00:35.172
Type "Learn to count and compare
naira." in the Description box.

00:00:36.628 --> 00:00:40.678
Tick Maths.

00:00:40.928 --> 00:00:46.529
Type "naira, money,
counting" in the Tags box.

00:00:46.779 --> 00:00:52.386
Select G from the Maturity rating list.

00:00:52.636 --> 00:00:56.486
Click Save changes.

00:00:56.736 --> 00:01:02.666
Wait until you see Changes saved.
